{"id":"e16t1","name":"Partitioned Sales Folders","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","input_dir"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>A retail chain stores its sales in a data lake with <b>Hive-style partitions</b>:</p>\n<pre class=\"exv\">input_dir/\n  year=YYYY/\n    month=MM/\n      day=DD/\n        store=&lt;store_id&gt;/\n          part-&lt;n&gt;.csv</pre>\n<p>Each CSV file has a header and the columns <code>sale_id</code>, <code>sku</code>, <code>qty</code> and <code>unit_price</code>. The date and the store are <b>not</b> columns of the files: they come only from the folder names. Some files only contain the header. Folders whose name does not have the form <code>key=value</code> (for example <code>_tmp</code>) must be ignored, as well as files that do not end with <code>.csv</code>.</p>\n<p>A sale can be written in several files of the same store and day (the job was replayed): rows with the same <code>store</code>, day and <code>sale_id</code> are the same sale and count once. Rows with a <code>qty</code> or <code>unit_price</code> that is not a number are ignored.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return, for each store and day, the columns <code>store</code> (string), <code>sale_date</code> (date), <code>sales</code> (long, number of distinct sales), <code>units</code> (long) and <code>revenue</code> (double, <code>sum(qty * unit_price)</code> rounded to 2 decimals), sorted by <code>sale_date</code>, then <code>store</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-0.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,2,10.0\n2,B,1,5.5\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-1.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n2,B,1,5.5\n3,C,x,1\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S02/part-0.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-0.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,3,9.99\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/_SUCCESS</code></p><pre class=\"exv\"></pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/_tmp/year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-9.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n99,Z,100,100\n</pre><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>store</th><th>sale_date</th><th>sales</th><th>units</th><th>revenue</th></tr><tr><td>S01</td><td>2026-03-01</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>25.5</td></tr><tr><td>S02</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>29.97</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"import os\nfrom pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, input_dir: str) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return spark.read.option(\"header\", True).csv(input_dir)\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["partitions Hive","basePath","colonnes de partition","fichiers vides"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":{"root":"input_dir","files":{"year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,2,10.0\n2,B,1,5.5\n","year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-1.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n2,B,1,5.5\n3,C,x,1\n","year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S02/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n","year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,3,9.99\n","year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/_SUCCESS":"","_tmp/year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-9.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n99,Z,100,100\n"}},"visible":[{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,2,10.0\n2,B,1,5.5\n","year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S01/part-1.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n2,B,1,5.5\n3,C,x,1\n","year=2026/month=03/day=01/store=S02/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n","year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-0.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,3,9.99\n","year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/_SUCCESS":"","_tmp/year=2026/month=03/day=02/store=S02/part-9.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n99,Z,100,100\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["store","sale_date","sales","units","revenue"],"rows":[["S01","2026-03-01",2,3,25.5],["S02","2026-03-02",1,3,29.97]]}},{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"year=2025/month=12/day=31/store=7/a.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,1,1.0\n1,A,1,1.0\n","year=2026/month=01/day=01/store=7/a.csv":"sale_id,sku,qty,unit_price\n1,A,2,2.5\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["store","sale_date","sales","units","revenue"],"rows":[["7","2025-12-31",1,1,1.0],["7","2026-01-01",1,2,5.0]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}